                                                                        <rect key="frame" x="10" y="0.0" width="355" height="137.66666666666666"/>
                                                                        <string key="text">1. Request for availing bus facility in the mid-session is not allowed, it is to be w.e.f. April
2. Withdrawal from the bus facility is only allowed at the end of a quarter with a fortnight's notice in writing.
3. Filling of this form is no guarantee that the seat in the bus will be automatically or immediately available.
4. Students must carry the ‘Bus Card’ while travelling in the school bus &amp; show the card when asked.
5. Roll call is taken in the bus. If a child deliberately misses the bus in the afternoon, thrice during the session, he/she may be debarred from using the bus.</string>
                                                                        <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="Georgia" family="Georgia" pointSize="11"/>
