                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="70" width="295" height="368"/>
                                                <string key="text">I hereby agree, 
1. I may be required to travel in the bus a maximum of four times in the year from the first stop to the school in the morning and from the school to the last stop in the afternoon, as per the schedule provided, at least a week in advance. I agree to do this or arrange a substitute when required. 
2. The school is held indemnified against all claims through accident or any other cause. 
3. I have read the transport rules given in the school almanac and my ward will follow them.</string>
